					<a href="#about">About</a>
					<a href="/resume-jacob-beallor.pdf" target="_blank">Resume</a>
					<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacob-beallor" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="nav-icon">
