					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="hero">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="hero-inner">
					<div class="hero-left">
						<div class="hero-status">
							<span class="status-dot"></span>
							<span class="status-text">Fintech Analytics Manager · Toronto</span>
						</div>
						<h1 class="hero-name">Jacob<br>Beallor</h1>
						<p class="hero-tagline">
							Experienced data analyst specializing in turning complex data into
							actionable insights. Predictive models, self-serve dashboards, and data
							infrastructure — built to help teams move with confidence.
						</p>
						<div class="hero-cta">
							<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacob-beallor" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta-primary">
								<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.32 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.79M6.88 8.56a1.68 1.68 0 0 0 1.68-1.68c0-.93-.75-1.69-1.68-1.69a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.69 1.69c0 .93.76 1.68 1.69 1.68m1.39 9.94v-8.37H5.5v8.37h2.77z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
								LinkedIn
							</a>
							<a href="https://github.com/jacobbeallor" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta-secondary">
								<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2A10 10 0 0 0 2 12c0 4.42 2.87 8.17 6.84 9.5.5.08.66-.23.66-.5v-1.69c-2.77.6-3.36-1.34-3.36-1.34-.46-1.16-1.11-1.47-1.11-1.47-.91-.62.07-.6.07-.6 1 .07 1.53 1.03 1.53 1.03.87 1.52 2.34 1.07 2.91.83.09-.65.35-1.09.63-1.34-2.22-.25-4.55-1.11-4.55-4.92 0-1.11.38-2 1.03-2.71-.1-.25-.45-1.29.1-2.64 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.02.79-.22 1.65-.33 2.5-.33.85 0 1.71.11 2.5.33 1.91-1.29 2.75-1.02 2.75-1.02.55 1.35.2 2.39.1 2.64.65.71 1.03 1.6 1.03 2.71 0 3.82-2.34 4.66-4.57 4.91.36.31.69.92.69 1.85V21c0 .27.16.59.67.5C19.14 20.16 22 16.42 22 12A10 10 0 0 0 12 2z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
								GitHub
							</a>
							<a href="/resume-jacob-beallor.pdf" target="_blank" class="cta-secondary">
								<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-6-6z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M16 13H8M16 17H8M10 9H8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
								Resume ↗
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="hero-right">
						<div class="hero-photo-wrap">
							<div class="photo-frame-accent"></div>
							<img src="/headshot.jpg" alt="Jacob Beallor" class="headshot" />
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Projects -->
		<section id="projects" class="section projects-section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-head reveal">
					<span class="section-label">01 — PROJECTS</span>
					<h2 class="section-title">Selected Work</h2>
					<p class="section-sub">Personal projects built for fun, learning, and sometimes profit</p>
				</div>
				<div class="projects-grid">
					<a href="https://spotify-wrapped-revisited.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card reveal">
						<div class="project-num">01</div>
						<h3 class="project-title">Spotify Wrapped 2.0</h3>
						<p class="project-desc">
							Spotify Wrapped drops once a year, but why wait? I built my own dashboard to explore 9 years of
							listening history anytime I want. A Python + DuckDB pipeline transforms 88,000+ plays into clean
							aggregates, then a Next.js app with ECharts brings it to life.
						</p>
						<div class="project-footer">
							<div class="project-tags">
								<span>Python</span><span>DuckDB</span><span>Next.js</span><span>ECharts</span>
							</div>
							<span class="project-cta">View dashboard ↗</span>
						</div>
					</a>

					<a href="https://synesthesia-color-calendar.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card reveal" data-delay="0.1">
						<div class="project-num">02</div>
						<h3 class="project-title">Color³ — Synesthesia Calendar</h3>
						<p class="project-desc">
							Inspired by my girlfriend's synesthesia — January is blue, Friday is green, the 17th is orange.
							Map your own color associations to months, days, and weekdays, then discover rare "Color³ days"
							when all three align.
						</p>
						<div class="project-footer">
							<div class="project-tags">
								<span>React</span><span>Data Viz</span><span>Crowdsourced</span>
							</div>
							<span class="project-cta">View live app ↗</span>
						</div>
					</a>

					<a href="https://4things.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card reveal" data-delay="0.2">
						<div class="project-num">03</div>
						<h3 class="project-title">4Things — Party Game</h3>
						<p class="project-desc">
							Think you know your friends? Each round, you pick your favorite from four options, then predict
							what everyone else chose. Simple concept, but it sparks the best debates. Full-stack real-time
							multiplayer with custom game logic and live synchronization.
						</p>
						<div class="project-footer">
							<div class="project-tags">
								<span>Full-Stack</span><span>Real-time</span><span>Multiplayer</span>
							</div>
							<span class="project-cta">Play at 4things.ca ↗</span>
						</div>
					</a>

					<article class="project-card reveal" data-delay="0.3">
						<div class="project-num">04</div>
						<h3 class="project-title">Arbitrage Betting Finder</h3>
						<p class="project-desc">
							Built a Python app that identified arbitrage opportunities across multiple sportsbooks in real-time.
							Scraped odds, calculated risk-free profit scenarios, and sent Slack notifications when opportunities
							arose. Generated $25k+ annually before betting sites started limiting my accounts.
						</p>
						<div class="project-footer">
							<div class="project-tags">
								<span>Python</span><span>Scraping</span><span>Automation</span>
							</div>
							<span class="project-cta killed">☠️ Too successful for its own good</span>
						</div>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- How I Work -->
		<section id="approach" class="section approach-section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-head reveal">
					<span class="section-label">02 — APPROACH</span>
					<h2 class="section-title">How I Work</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="approach-grid">
					<div class="approach-card reveal">
						<div class="approach-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M12 6m-8 0a8 3 0 1 0 16 0a8 3 0 1 0 -16 0" />
								<path d="M4 6v6a8 3 0 0 0 16 0v-6" />
								<path d="M4 12v6a8 3 0 0 0 16 0v-6" />
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Data infrastructure first</h3>
						<p>Production-ready data models with dbt that improve data quality and enable self-serve analytics. Good infrastructure means teams can move faster with confidence.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="approach-card reveal" data-delay="0.1">
						<div class="approach-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill="none"><path d="M24 0v24H0V0zM12.594 23.258l-.012.002-.071.035-.02.004-.014-.004-.071-.036c-.01-.003-.019 0-.024.006l-.004.01-.017.428.005.02.01.013.104.074.015.004.012-.004.104-.074.012-.016.004-.017-.017-.427c-.002-.01-.009-.017-.016-.018m.264-.113-.014.002-.184.093-.01.01-.003.011.018.43.005.012.008.008.201.092c.012.004.023 0 .029-.008l.004-.014-.034-.614c-.003-.012-.01-.02-.02-.022m-.715.002a.023.023 0 0 0-.027.006l-.006.014-.034.614c0 .012.007.02.017.024l.015-.002.201-.093.01-.008.003-.011.018-.43-.003-.012-.01-.01z"/><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 5.331 15.12l-.226.177.71 2.84a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.324 1.857L16.36 22H7.64a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.481-1.735l.026-.129.71-2.84A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 12 2m3.22 16H8.78l-.5 2h7.44zM12 4a6.5 6.5 0 0 0-3.466 12h6.932A6.5 6.5 0 0 0 12 4m4.11 5.56a2.896 2.896 0 0 0 .532.808c.15.159.317.3.5.422l.175.107c.08.045.08.16 0 .206l-.176.107a2.825 2.825 0 0 0-1.03 1.23.12.12 0 0 1-.221 0 2.869 2.869 0 0 0-1.031-1.229l-.176-.108a.118.118 0 0 1 0-.206l.176-.107a2.825 2.825 0 0 0 1.03-1.23.12.12 0 0 1 .221 0M12.816 5.6c.071-.158.297-.158.368 0a4.78 4.78 0 0 0 .887 1.347 4.715 4.715 0 0 0 1.125.882.196.196 0 0 1 0 .342 4.743 4.743 0 0 0-1.126.882 4.78 4.78 0 0 0-.886 1.346.201.201 0 0 1-.368 0 4.78 4.78 0 0 0-.887-1.347 4.715 4.715 0 0 0-1.125-.88.196.196 0 0 1 0-.343 4.743 4.743 0 0 0 1.126-.882 4.78 4.78 0 0 0 .886-1.346"/></g></svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Predictive over reactive</h3>
						<p>Building models that forecast outcomes and identify opportunities before they're obvious. Python, SQL, and statistical rigor help turn data into foresight.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="approach-card reveal" data-delay="0.2">
						<div class="approach-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill="none"><path d="M24 0v24H0V0zM12.593 23.258l-.011.002-.071.035-.02.004-.014-.004-.071-.035c-.01-.004-.019-.001-.024.005l-.004.01-.017.428.005.02.01.013.104.074.015.004.012-.004.104-.074.012-.016.004-.017-.017-.427c-.002-.01-.009-.017-.017-.018m.265-.113-.013.002-.185.093-.01.01-.003.011.018.43.005.012.008.007.201.093c.012.004.023 0 .029-.008l.004-.014-.034-.614c-.003-.012-.01-.02-.02-.022m-.715.002a.023.023 0 0 0-.027.006l-.006.014-.034.614c0 .012.007.02.017.024l.015-.002.201-.093.01-.008.004-.011.017-.43-.003-.012-.01-.01z"/><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2c.375 0 .745.02 1.11.061a1 1 0 0 1-.22 1.988 8 8 0 1 0 7.061 7.061 1 1 0 1 1 1.988-.22c.04.365.061.735.061 1.11 0 5.523-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12 6.477 2 12 2m-.032 5.877a1 1 0 0 1-.719 1.217A3.002 3.002 0 0 0 12 15a3.002 3.002 0 0 0 2.906-2.25 1 1 0 0 1 1.936.5A5.002 5.002 0 0 1 7 12a5.002 5.002 0 0 1 3.75-4.842 1 1 0 0 1 1.218.719m6.536-5.75a1 1 0 0 1 .617.923v1.83h1.829a1 1 0 0 1 .707 1.707L18.12 10.12a1 1 0 0 1-.707.293H15l-1.828 1.829a1 1 0 0 1-1.415-1.415L13.586 9V6.586a1 1 0 0 1 .293-.707l3.535-3.536a1 1 0 0 1 1.09-.217m-1.383 3.337L15.586 7v1.414H17l1.536-1.535h-.415a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"/></g></svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Impact-driven analysis</h3>
						<p>Every analysis should drive a decision. I prioritize work that directly influences product strategy, revenue, or user experience — not just interesting insights.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="approach-card reveal" data-delay="0.3">
						<div class="approach-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill="none"><path d="M24 0v24H0V0zM12.594 23.258l-.012.002-.071.035-.02.004-.014-.004-.071-.036c-.01-.003-.019 0-.024.006l-.004.01-.017.428.005.02.01.013.104.074.015.004.012-.004.104-.074.012-.016.004-.017-.017-.427c-.002-.01-.009-.017-.016-.018m.264-.113-.014.002-.184.093-.01.01-.003.011.018.43.005.012.008.008.201.092c.012.004.023 0 .029-.008l.004-.014-.034-.614c-.003-.012-.01-.02-.02-.022m-.715.002a.023.023 0 0 0-.027.006l-.006.014-.034.614c0 .012.007.02.017.024l.015-.002.201-.093.01-.008.003-.011.018-.43-.003-.012-.01-.01z"/><path fill="currentColor" d="M20 9a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H9.414l.793.793a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414l-2.496-2.496a.997.997 0 0 1-.287-.567L6 17.991a.996.996 0 0 1 .237-.638l.056-.06 2.5-2.5a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 1.414L9.414 17H13a6 6 0 0 0 6-6v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1m-4.793-6.207 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 1-1.414-1.414L14.586 7H11a6 6 0 0 0-6 6v1a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-1a8 8 0 0 1 8-8h3.586l-.793-.793a1 1 0 0 1 1.414-1.414"/></g></svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Iterate and improve</h3>
						<p>Whether it's a dashboard, model, or data pipeline, I constantly refine based on feedback and changing business needs. Nothing is ever truly "done."</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- About -->
		<section id="about" class="section about-section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="about-grid">
					<div class="about-left reveal">
						<span class="section-label">03 — ABOUT</span>
						<h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
						<p>
							I'm a Fintech Analytics Manager at Jobber with a background in applied mathematics and engineering
							from Queen's University. I specialize in building predictive models, designing data infrastructure
							with dbt, and creating self-serve analytics that empower teams to make data-driven decisions.
						</p>
						<p>
							I'm also a CFA Level I charterholder (passed Feb 2024). Beyond my day job, I build data projects
							that solve real problems — from real-time multiplayer games to arbitrage detection systems. I believe
							the best way to learn is by building.
						</p>
						<p class="location-tag">
							<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
							Based in Toronto
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="timeline reveal" data-delay="0.15">
						<div class="tl-item">
							<span class="tl-year">2025</span>
							<div class="tl-info">
								<span class="tl-role">Fintech Analytics Manager</span>
								<span class="tl-company">Jobber</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="tl-item">
							<span class="tl-year">2024</span>
							<div class="tl-info">
								<span class="tl-role">Senior Fintech Analyst</span>
								<span class="tl-company">Jobber</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="tl-item">
							<span class="tl-year">2022</span>
							<div class="tl-info">
								<span class="tl-role">Data Analyst</span>
								<span class="tl-company">7Shifts</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="tl-item">
							<span class="tl-year">2020</span>
							<div class="tl-info">
								<span class="tl-role">Data Scientist</span>
								<span class="tl-company">Bell Canada</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="tl-item">
							<span class="tl-year">2020</span>
							<div class="tl-info">
								<span class="tl-role">B.Eng Applied Mathematics</span>
								<span class="tl-company">Queen's University</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Personal -->
		<section class="section personal-section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-head reveal">
					<span class="section-label">04 — PERSONAL</span>
					<h2 class="section-title">Beyond the Data</h2>
					<p class="section-sub">
						When I'm not analyzing data, you'll find me on trails with my dog,
						exploring new cities, or chasing good coffee.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="photo-grid">
					<div class="photo-item reveal">
						<img src="/dog.jpg" alt="My dog" loading="lazy" />
						<p class="photo-caption">My hiking companion</p>
					</div>
					<div class="photo-item reveal" data-delay="0.15">
						<img src="/travel.jpg" alt="Travel photo" loading="lazy" />
						<p class="photo-caption">Recent adventure</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="footer">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="footer-inner">
					<div class="footer-left">
						<span class="footer-logo">JB</span>
						<p>Always open to interesting conversations<br>and collaboration opportunities.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="footer-right">
						<div class="footer-links">
							<a href="/resume-jacob-beallor.pdf" target="_blank">Resume</a>
							<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacob-beallor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
							<a href="https://github.com/jacobbeallor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
						</div>
						<p class="footer-copy">Jacob Beallor · 2025</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</footer>

	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* ─── Variables ─────────────────────────────────── */
	:root {
		--bg:           #0c0e0b;
		--surface:      #141713;
		--card:         #181c17;
		--card-hover:   #1e2420;
		--accent:       #b8ef4c;
		--accent-warm:  #e07c52;
		--text:         #e2e0d4;
		--muted:        #6d7b6c;
		--line:         rgba(184, 239, 76, 0.12);
		--line-mid:     rgba(184, 239, 76, 0.22);
		--line-strong:  rgba(184, 239, 76, 0.55);
		--font-display: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
		--font-mono:    'JetBrains Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
		--font-body:    'Instrument Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
	}

	/* ─── Global ─────────────────────────────────────── */
	:global(html) {
		scroll-behavior: smooth;
		scrollbar-width: thin;
		scrollbar-color: var(--accent) var(--surface);
	}
	:global(body) {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		background: var(--bg);
		color: var(--text);
		line-height: 1.65;
